# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MAINA AUDIO PLATFORM — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your API keys.

# Google Gemini API: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Groq Cloud API: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter API: https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# OpenAI API: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Generic Key
AI_API_KEY=
